{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">熱帶風暴舒力基昨日在東京以南水域，向東北方向掠過。日本氣象廳指舒力基最高風速每小時64.8公里、最高陣風達每小時90公里。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕擷取畫面 2026-10-02 112722.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265g3BdgEqrq1790912409.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕擷取畫面 2026-10-02 112722.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">其中千葉縣受災嚴重。當地近期曾經歷暴雨，部分地區土壤已經鬆動，加上昨日連場大雨，尤災害風險上升，氣象廳呼籲居民警惕。鴨川市、酒酒井町均發生山泥傾瀉。君津市一處二手車場水浸，多輛汽車被浸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕擷取畫面 2026-10-02 112649.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TaOAWUVoQO1790912380.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕擷取畫面 2026-10-02 112649.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T04:39:05.730090+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}